Output hud-resume.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1500
Set Height 760
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 10ms
Env TERM xterm-256color
Env COLORTERM truecolor
Hide
Type "cd ~/Documents/projects/Overmind && clear && codex-rs/target/debug/codex -m composer-2.5 resume 01a11889-dbbd-7430-b0ee-97e7f0867538"
Enter
Show
Sleep 16s
Screenshot overmind-hud-cursor-resume.png
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 2s
